  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Folke Bernadotteakademin (FBA) bedriver utbildning, samtr&#xe4;ning och &#xf6;vning f&#xf6;r att f&#xf6;rbereda svensk och utl&#xe4;ndsk personal f&#xf6;r deltagande i internationella fredsinsatser.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Folke Bernadotte Academy (FBA) offers training and education in order to strengthen the capacity of individuals, institutions and the international community working for peace.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">FBA:s utbildningar och &#xf6;vningar, som genomf&#xf6;rs med fokus mot &#xe5;tta olika kunskapsomr&#xe5;den, syftar till att st&#xe4;rka individers, institutioners och i f&#xf6;rl&#xe4;ngningen det internationella samfundets kapacitet att verka f&#xf6;r fred.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The agency&apos;s courses and exercises focus on eight different thematic areas considered as helping in achieving the development assistance policy platform&apos;s targets, especially those that involve strengthening democracy and equality, increasing respect for</narrative>
  </description>
